Loaad the Data → Text/CSV → data/processed/fans_segmented.csv

Create these DAX measures:

Total Fans = COUNTROWS(fans_segmented)

Churn Rate = DIVIDE(
    CALCULATE(COUNTROWS(fans_segmented), fans_segmented[churned] = 1),
    [Total Fans]
)

Avg CLV = AVERAGE(fans_segmented[clv_estimate_eur])

Avg Engagement = AVERAGE(fans_segmented[engagement_score])

At Risk Fans = CALCULATE(
    COUNTROWS(fans_segmented),
    fans_segmented[segment_name] = "At Risk"
)

Build visuals on :

Card visuals: Total Fans, Churn Rate, Avg CLV, At Risk Fans

Bar chart: Fans by segment

Scatter plot: Engagement vs CLV, coloured by segment

Line chart: Churn rate by membership years

